Protocol: PasswordFixed

Types: Agent A,B,s;
       Number Payload,NB;
       Function pk,pw,h;

Knowledge:
A: A,B,s,pk(s),pw(A,B),h;
B: A,B,pw(A,B),pk(B),inv(pk(B)),pk(s),{B,pk(B)}inv(pk(s)),h

Actions:
# B creates a fresh challenge and sends Bob's CA-signed public-key certificate.
B->A: NB,{B,pk(B)}inv(pk(s))
# Alice returns the challenge, payload, identities, and password inside encryption to Bob.
A->B: {A,B,NB,Payload,pw(A,B)}pk(B)

Goals:
B authenticates A on NB,Payload
Payload secret between A,B
pw(A,B) guessable secret between A,B

